"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="인증 정보 쓰기 · 지우기" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#3B5BDB;fontColor=#1A1D24;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="인증 정보 읽기" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#B7791F;fontColor=#1A1D24;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="잔고 · 체결 수집" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#B7791F;fontColor=#1A1D24;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="푸시 발송" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#3B5BDB;fontColor=#1A1D24;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0;exitY=0.8;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="푸시(iOS)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#6B7280;fontColor=#1A1D24;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="• 사용자 개념은 백엔드 안에만 있다. 데이터팀 표는 계좌를 불투명 문자열(account_ref)로만 안다&lt;br&gt;• 두 팀 표 사이에 FK를 걸지 않는다. 한 팀의 배포가 다른 팀을 기다리지 않게 하려고&lt;br&gt;• 앱은 클러스터와 같은 네트워크에서만 서버에 닿는다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;fontSize=12;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1A1D24;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="630" width="740" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
